  "meaningBoundary": "Selected image default records and initializer argument joins are direct. Section-three initialization compares its fixed key with one mutable pointer entry using an exact named CRT strcmp body, then passes the selected record selector and legacy payload to application. Section-one initialization directly passes its legacy payload with the all-word selector. Success flags follow nonnegative application results; no-match and negative application exits are separate. Static pointer/string equality establishes the file-default selection, conditional on readable terminated strings and unchanged mutable entries. Legacy payload semantics beyond independently proved application reads, later pointer overwrite, allocator results, corpus use, public control naming and live activation remain outside this proof."
